---
// indice's docs are light-only, matching the landing page. Override Starlight's
// ThemeProvider so it always renders in the native light theme (which keeps all
// of Starlight's own light colours — asides, code, borders — internally
// consistent) instead of following the system preference.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
</script>
